; Step 5.12 selected-import support: a CBORK library with two rules.
; `public-rule` is exported and explicitly selected by the consumer,
; but the consumer does not reference it, so W004/W005 are expected.
; `private-helper` is referenced and triggers a W003 cross-file
; direct-use-export violation.

;@ CBORK: Library

;@ CBORK: Export
public-rule = uint

private-helper = bstr .size 16
